post_install() {
    cat <<'EOF'
Slick Mod has been installed.

To make slack:// links open in Slick instead of the default Slack, set Slick as the default handler in your desktop environment's settings, or run:

        xdg-mime default dev.slick.byoe.desktop x-scheme-handler/slack

To check the current handler, run:

        xdg-mime query default x-scheme-handler/slack

EOF
}
post_remove(){
    cat <<'EOF'
Slick Mod has been removed.

If you previously set Slick as your default handler for slack:// links, you may want to select another handler in your desktop environment's settings.

To check the current handler, run:

        xdg-mime query default x-scheme-handler/slack

To put it back to Slack, run:

        xdg-mime default slack.desktop x-scheme-handler/slack
EOF
}